    "name": "Request Copy of Written Statement of Unauthorized Debit (WSUD) API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "A Originating Depository Financial Institution (ODFI) wants to send an automated electronic request to the Receiving Depository Financial Institution (RDFI) for a copy of the WSUD which includes details on how to send the copy of the WSUD, and receive back a real time acknowledgement when the request is received. \n\nContact Support:\n Email: info@afinis.org",
